Reserved Font Name: Selawik. Selawik is a Microsoft trademark. The RFN
clause only bites on MODIFIED copies, which would have to be renamed —
these are byte-identical to the release, so the name stays.

Selawik 1.01, https://github.com/microsoft/Selawik — Microsoft's own
open-source, metric-compatible substitute for Segoe UI. Vendored
unmodified from the 1.01 release archive (selawkb.woff2), which ships WOFF2
directly; no conversion or subsetting was done.

Used only by the Windows 7 skin, and only where the real Segoe UI is
absent — the font stack asks for Segoe UI first.
